{"nodes": [{"id": "brain_log_67_dd3_hurdle_saturation_result_dd3_hurdle_saturation", "label": "D-D3 evidence \u2014 the occurrence gate's binary part is Cragg's, saturated", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "brain/log/67_DD3_hurdle_saturation_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A verification run, not an experiment: it checks an estimator-equivalence claim that would otherwise have to be asserted, which the standing instruction on R6 forbids."}, {"id": "brain_log_67_dd3_hurdle_saturation_result_p_trade", "label": "signals/occurrence.py::p_trade", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "brain/log/67_DD3_hurdle_saturation_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Returns E[occurrence | day-of-week] over the training labels \u2014 a saturated nonparametric estimator. It evaluates to 0 or 1 at Beer Hall because the closure calendar is deterministic, not because the code forces it."}, {"id": "brain_log_67_dd3_hurdle_saturation_result_cragg_1971", "label": "Cragg (1971) \u2014 hurdle / two-part specification", "file_type": "paper", "source_file": "brain/log/67_DD3_hurdle_saturation_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "brain_log_67_dd3_hurdle_saturation_result_mullahy_1986", "label": "Mullahy (1986) \u2014 binomial logit first stage", "file_type": "paper", "source_file": "brain/log/67_DD3_hurdle_saturation_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "brain_log_67_dd3_hurdle_saturation_result_complete_separation", "label": "Complete separation in the deterministic DOW cells", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/log/67_DD3_hurdle_saturation_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "|coef| reaches 11.46 and is still diverging at 2000 BFGS iterations while the fitted probability converges to the cell frequency \u2014 so the parameterisation breaks at a deterministic calendar, not the design."}, {"id": "brain_log_67_dd3_hurdle_saturation_result_covariate_poverty_limitation", "label": "The honest limitation is covariate poverty, not estimation", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/log/67_DD3_hurdle_saturation_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cragg's and Mullahy's gains are about separating the two processes, which this design has; what the first stage lacks is a rich covariate set, conditioning on DOW alone."}, {"id": "brain_log_67_dd3_hurdle_saturation_result_synthetic_scope_caveat", "label": "Scope caveat \u2014 synthetic data, estimator-equivalence only", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/log/67_DD3_hurdle_saturation_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "It establishes a property of the two estimators, not of this estate's data; the real p_trade cells must not be quoted from this run."}, {"id": "brain_log_67_dd3_hurdle_saturation_result_d_d3", "label": "D-D3 \u2014 defensible divergence, reclassified toward CONFORMS", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "brain/log/67_DD3_hurdle_saturation_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "brain_log_67_dd3_hurdle_saturation_result_dd3_hurdle_saturation", "target": "brain_log_67_dd3_hurdle_saturation_result_p_trade", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "brain/log/67_DD3_hurdle_saturation_result.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "brain_log_67_dd3_hurdle_saturation_resul